description = "4:36pm ← lights flickering again. Two short- one out- one flicker

4:47pm ← surge blew spark plugs 1 and 2 in succession

5:13pm ← too many too close together, one full outage and one blip

11:28pm ← another sudden power surge, one full outage breakdown and two spark plugs blown

12:02am ← machine did two long whirring noises, seemed abnormal

1:34am ← blew another spark plug, going to bed, will fix in morning
"
